E</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini大模型升级：支持在对话中直接生成与编辑多格式文件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e45cf7981e103bc4cd953352c0009f75.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近日宣布Gemini对话式AI大模型迎来重大功能升级，正式推出文件内直接修改能力。即日起，网页端与移动端用户可对PDF、谷歌文档、谷歌表格、幻灯片、Markdown、TXT及代码文件进行实时生成、预览及全屏编辑。其中，PDF预览与编辑支持全平台，其余格式主要落地于网页端。用户无需退出应用即可深度修改内容，支持选中文本定向提问及表格转图表等高级交互。此次更新标志着Gemini从单一内容生成工具向沉浸式协作工作台演进，强化了人机交互闭环体验。随着各大AI厂商持续优化对话式办公流程，此类功能将进一步重塑用户的数字工作流，提升AI辅助生产力的交互流畅度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌AI搜索冲击广告业务，第三季度搜索广告收入不及预期</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d4c56ca5191ff6c5b5ae4b6a63a0c6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌AI搜索冲击广告业务，第三季度搜索广告收入不及预期AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 30, 202621谷歌在2026年第三季度财报电话会议上披露，AI Mode生成式搜索正在对传统搜索广告业务造成一定冲击，AI生成的摘要和回答降低了搜索结果的商业变现空间。谷歌首席商务官Philipp Schindler表示，AI回答改变了搜索结果的呈现方式，也使广告业务的变现难度增加。财务数据显示，谷歌第三季度搜索广告收入达到634亿美元，同比增长12%，但仍低于华尔街预期约16亿美元，增速也未达到分析师预测的15%。财报公布后，Alphabet股价周四盘中一度下跌13%，市值蒸发超过5000亿美元，创下该公司单日市值损失纪录。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI撤回ChatGPT Pro额度削减计划并宣布各档位用量翻倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于10月29日宣布，立即上调ChatGPT Pro及Business Premium订阅计划的Work与Codex用量额度，Pro 100、Pro 200及Pro 500三档额度均实现翻倍，Dots常驻AI助理的扩展用量则独立计算。此次调整直接推翻了此前计划于10月29日生效的额度削减方案。此前，OpenAI曾以模型效率提升为由，计划将Pro 200额度砍半，引发订阅用户强烈不满。官方明确表示，此次额度翻倍即刻生效，老用户无需等待续订。不过，OpenAI强调额度消耗与模型选择、任务复杂度及上下文长度高度相关，其中Fast模式消耗额度约为标准模式的2.5倍，Ultrafast模式则高达8倍。对于重度用户而言，虽然名义额度翻倍，但实际产出仍受限于具体的任务模式与工具调用频率，产能提升效果取决于具体使用场</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Mistral AI开源旗舰模型Large 4，1T参数权重支持免费商用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/683c6b65aaf72e4616cc633e8243ae31.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Mistral AI正式开源其旗舰多模态模型Mistral Large 4（代号le Chonk），开发者与企业可获取权重进行修改、微调及常规商业化应用。该模型基于修改版MIT许可证发布，仅限制云厂商进行MaaS转售。Mistral Large 4总参数量达1万亿，激活参数为490亿，由3800块NVIDIA Grace Blackwell GPU在欧洲自有数据中心训练完成。在性能表现上，该模型在Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index中取得48%得分，与GLM-5.3持平，但平均任务Token消耗降低47%，显著提升了推理经济性。目前，Mistral已公布在线API定价，输入每百万Token为0.70美元，输出为2.10美元。此次开源旨在通过同等能力下的低调用成本，进一步强</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude移动端更新，正式接入Apple CarPlay支持车载语音交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/33d78a61fadbf289c2ed5b3d6e3f7259.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于10月29日发布Claude移动端重大更新，核心亮点是iPhone版语音模式正式接入Apple CarPlay，驾驶者可通过语音与Claude交互，无需手动操作。此次更新覆盖iPhone、iPad、Android、Chromebook及桌面端。iPad与iPhone Duo新增并排展示功能，支持对话与文档、代码或设计内容同时显示。Android端在大屏与折叠设备上补齐了侧边栏、触控板右键及快捷键支持，并实现多账号一键切换。此外，Claude新增24种语言支持，累计达33种，语音响应速度与环境识别准确度显著提升。Anthropic还预告，iPhone与iPad即将支持下拉搜索功能，以快速检索历史对话与项目。此次布局车载场景，标志着Claude在Siri与Google Assistant之外，成</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
